\strong{Gene-level step.} For each gene, the bulk value in sample
\eqn{n} is modelled as \eqn{\sum_k \pi_{nk} Y_{nk}} with
\eqn{Y_{nk} \sim N(\mu_k, \sigma^2_k)}. Component means and variances
